8677_622769229433143_1878365053994754488_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c7TpOIVMtUMQ7kNvwHoY6-7&_nc_oc=AdqvPh8ELQd0Rz_tmeXDfPoSvOeUUh61PpOen3KGJRetaqs3-e6EirrNYAldcf2mkZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af28FTysjKSCqYXda6x8WAR-Ai0jcuPMkVSC58bfJYbnFw&oe=69E77667"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FLOculus_TrailerCover2.png", "id": "434900168706817", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974741_434900172040150_3046569544541794558_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tH4k19hs_fQQ7kNvwHIDr3c&_nc_oc=Adoi6e9wcdG11SBgSZaqhDf7EyEuQ76_aMPm8cCXhEqHa3CfkOSfMwhq11VKMzHUDRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2fgt-z4XwoKo7Q3LiFK8GE_gBF1CpgyVWOHfh0J9tB0w&oe=69E76BD3"}, "display_name": "Floreo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Floreo uses virtual reality to teach social, communication, behavioral, and life skills to individuals with Autism Spectrum Disorder and related diagnoses. Our immersive VR experiences are based on established, science-backed techniques and designed to be used in therapy, educational, or family settings. \n\nOur standalone version consists of three sensory room experiences: a marimba, an aquarium, and a cave filled with crystals.\n\nEnterprise users can pair with an iPad to access our extensive library of over 175 lessons that teach social, behavioral, communication and life skills in a fun and engaging way. Our clinical team works hand-in-hand with game developers to create evidence-based lessons for individuals with ASD and other diagnoses to safely learn important skills in a controlled virtual reality environment. Floreo is running several research studies, including a study in collaboration with the Center for Autism Research at CHOP and National Institutes of Health.", "short_description": "Virtual Reality to provide calming spaces and to teach emotional regulation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "de